      "ownershipVehicle": "AustralianSuper Infrastructure Portfolio",
      "description": "Transurban Chesapeake LLC is the concession platform that owns the entities operating the 495, 95 and 395 Express Lanes in Northern Virginia, including the Fredericksburg Extension and 495 NEXT. It develops, finances, operates and maintains dynamically priced express lanes serving motorists, high-occupancy vehicles, buses and permitted commercial traffic in partnership with VDOT. At June 30, 2026, Transurban reported 50% ownership, AustralianSuper 25%, CPP Investments 15% and UniSuper 10%; only AustralianSuper and CPP Investments are tracked infrastructure-manager owners here. The 495 concession covered 26.5 kilometres and the 95/395/FredEx concession 79 kilometres, each running through December 2087. No platform sale, secondary transfer or signed pending exit was identified through August 18, 2026. Chesapeake Partnership and Chesapeake toll road network are aliases for the same manager-level platform; individual roads and extensions are components, not separate PortCos.",
